"theories on engine design. We believe her theories have practical "
"applications to our ship maneuvering systems. You may want to talk to her "
"about putting her theories into practice on our naval vessels. She's "
"currently stationed on %s in %s."
msgstr "Paulina Lindquist, a noted research engineer recently published her latest theories on engine design. We believe her theories have practical applications to our ship manoeuvring systems. You may want to talk to her about putting her theories into practice on our naval vessels. She's currently stationed on %s in %s."

